  "id": "lunesta",
  "term": "Lunesta",
  "definition": "Lunesta is the brand name for eszopiclone, a nonbenzodiazepine sedative-hypnotic medication used to help induce sleep. It works in the central nervous system by enhancing GABA-related inhibitory activity, producing a sleep-promoting effect with little significant anti-anxiety action.",
